IMPORT `gia-protection`

-- Geographical Indications Act 2014, ss 2, 4, 8, 11 to 16, 24, 25, 29, 30, 38, 40, 41, 50, 52, 53, 59A, 73, 81 and the Schedule -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_geographical-indications-act-2014.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

